{
  "file" : "npc/merchants/clothes_dyer.txt",
  "scripts" : [
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 31,
      "npc" : "Dyer Ginedin Rephere",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "11... 12... Mmm... good. I think I'll be able to finish before tonight's party. Oh! I didn't notice you were here!",
      "translation" : "1、2...嗯...不错。我想今晚的派对前能做完。啊！我没注意到你在这里！"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 35,
      "npc" : "Dyer Ginedin Rephere",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "How may I assist you?",
      "translation" : "有什么可以帮你？"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "option",
      "line" : 37,
      "npc" : "Dyer Ginedin Rephere",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "- Talk",
      "translation" : "- 聊聊"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "option",
      "line" : 37,
      "npc" : "Dyer Ginedin Rephere",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "- Dye Clothing",
      "translation" : "- 染色衣服"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "option",
      "line" : 37,
      "npc" : "Dyer Ginedin Rephere",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "- Price List",
      "translation" : "- 价格表"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "option",
      "line" : 37,
      "npc" : "Dyer Ginedin Rephere",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "- ^777777Cancel^000000",
      "translation" : "- ^777777取消^000000"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 40,
      "npc" : "Dyer Ginedin Rephere",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "Life may have gotten a bit better, but when I look at all of the orders I've received... Whew!",
      "translation" : "生活也许比以前好了一些，不过看看我接到的这些订单...呼！"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 41,
      "npc" : "Dyer Ginedin Rephere",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "It seems that the young women of Rune-Midgarts must be very well off these days.",
      "translation" : "如今卢恩米德加尔特的年轻女性看来都很富裕。"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 44,
      "npc" : "Dyer Ginedin Rephere",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "Not that I think that they are indulging in anything luxurious, mind you.",
      "translation" : "当然，我不是说她们在追求奢侈生活。"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 45,
      "npc" : "Dyer Ginedin Rephere",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "I don't think there is anything wrong with the pursuit of beauty and being fashionable.",
      "translation" : "我认为追求美丽和时尚并没有错。"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 48,
      "npc" : "Dyer Ginedin Rephere",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "For us humans, who have no colorful fur or decorative scales, clothes are one of the few ways we have to display our personality, style, and beauty.",
      "translation" : "我们人类没有色彩斑斓的毛皮，也没有装饰性的鳞片，衣服是少数能展现个性、风格与美丽的方式之一。"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 51,
      "npc" : "Dyer Ginedin Rephere",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "Haha... When I think about it, I really feel that my job is worthwhile.  I believe that I provide a service that the people desire.",
      "translation" : "哈哈...想想看，我真的觉得自己的工作很有价值。我相信我提供的是大家需要的服务。"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 54,
      "npc" : "Dyer Ginedin Rephere",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "Can you feel it too? The energy that is released when rough fabric and leather are brought to life with color?.....",
      "translation" : "你也能感受到吗？粗糙的布料和皮革被色彩赋予生命时释放出的能量？..."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 57,
      "npc" : "Dyer Ginedin Rephere",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "Although the process is very tedious and time consuming, the joy and happiness I feel when a dress is finished more than makes up for all of the hard work!!",
      "translation" : "虽然过程非常繁琐，也很耗时间，但完成一件礼服时的喜悦和幸福，足以弥补所有辛劳！！"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 62,
      "npc" : "Dyer Ginedin Rephere",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "Sorry, I'm too busy with other jobs to dye your clothes.",
      "translation" : "抱歉，我正忙着其他工作，没法帮你染衣服。"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 65,
      "npc" : "Dyer Ginedin Rephere",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "Oh... you need my work? Well... okay, sounds good.",
      "translation" : "哦...你需要我帮忙？嗯...好吧，听起来不错。"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 68,
      "npc" : "Dyer Ginedin Rephere",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "Please choose a color",
      "translation" : "请选择一种颜色"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 69,
      "npc" : "Dyer Ginedin Rephere",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "that suits you.",
      "translation" : "适合你的颜色。"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 111,
      "npc" : "Dyer Ginedin Rephere",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "Wow, I've never seen clothes like that before! I'm sorry, but I don't think I can paint it.",
      "translation" : "哇，我从没见过这样的衣服！抱歉，我想我没办法为它染色。"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 116,
      "npc" : "Dyer Ginedin Rephere",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "Each color costs 10000z and 1 dye:",
      "translation" : "每种颜色需要10000 Zeny和1份染料："
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 118,
      "npc" : "Dyer Ginedin Rephere",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : " - ^FF4422Red^000000: Scarlet Dyestuffs",
      "translation" : " - ^FF4422红色^000000：猩红染料"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 119,
      "npc" : "Dyer Ginedin Rephere",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : " - ^D5A500Yellow^000000: Lemon Dyestuffs",
      "translation" : " - ^D5A500黄色^000000：柠檬染料"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 120,
      "npc" : "Dyer Ginedin Rephere",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : " - ^AA00AAViolet^000000: Violet Dyestuffs",
      "translation" : " - ^AA00AA紫色^000000：紫色染料"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 121,
      "npc" : "Dyer Ginedin Rephere",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : " - ^FF8800Orange^000000: Orange Dyestuffs",
      "translation" : " - ^FF8800橙色^000000：橙色染料"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 122,
      "npc" : "Dyer Ginedin Rephere",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : " - ^4422FFBlue^000000: CobaltBlue Dyestuffs",
      "translation" : " - ^4422FF蓝色^000000：钴蓝染料"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 123,
      "npc" : "Dyer Ginedin Rephere",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : " - ^009500Green^000000: DarkGreen Dyestuffs",
      "translation" : " - ^009500绿色^000000：深绿染料"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 124,
      "npc" : "Dyer Ginedin Rephere",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : " - Black: Black Dyestuffs",
      "translation" : " - 黑色：黑色染料"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 125,
      "npc" : "Dyer Ginedin Rephere",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : " - White: White Dyestuffs",
      "translation" : " - 白色：白色染料"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 134,
      "npc" : "Dyer Ginedin Rephere",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "Make yourself at home. Even though I don't have time for you.",
      "translation" : "请随意。不过我可没空招待你。"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 148,
      "npc" : "Dyer Ginedin Rephere",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "I can change your dye to",
      "translation" : "我可以把染料改回"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 149,
      "npc" : "Dyer Ginedin Rephere",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "the default for free.",
      "translation" : "默认颜色，而且免费。"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 150,
      "npc" : "Dyer Ginedin Rephere",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "Are you sure?",
      "translation" : "你确定吗？"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "option",
      "line" : 152,
      "npc" : "Dyer Ginedin Rephere",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "Yes",
      "translation" : "是"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "option",
      "line" : 152,
      "npc" : "Dyer Ginedin Rephere",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "No",
      "translation" : "否"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 156,
      "npc" : "Dyer Ginedin Rephere",
      "placeholders" : [
        ".@DyeName$[0]"
      ],
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "Your clothes have been dyed {0}.",
      "translation" : "你的衣服已经染成{0}。"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 163,
      "npc" : "Dyer Ginedin Rephere",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "For me to dye your clothes, I'll need the appropriate Dyestuffs. Please check my price list for the information.",
      "translation" : "我要用对应的染料才能为你的衣服染色。详情请查看价格表。"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 167,
      "npc" : "Dyer Ginedin Rephere",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "I'm sorry, but you don't have enough money.",
      "translation" : "抱歉，你的钱不够。"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 173,
      "npc" : "Dyer Ginedin Rephere",
      "placeholders" : [
        "((.@s)?.@DyeName$[getarg((.@s-1)*2)]:.@DyeName$[0])"
      ],
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "Your clothes have been dyed {0}.",
      "translation" : "你的衣服已经染成{0}。"
    }
  ]
